    4. Derive input: remove all dots from frames.
       For each frame color C with count N, generate N small random sprites of color C
       and scatter them in the right region (cols 13-21). Also add 1-2 distractor sprites
       with colors not matching any frame.
    5. Validate: no pattern overlaps frames or other patterns; all patterns fit in grid.
